		{"text": "sural, and bronchial wall", "rect": [47.97727411443536, 63.306836908513866, 143.65908882834694, 73.30684037642051], "fontSize": 10.000003467906645},
		{"text": "sharpness over other Bl", "rect": [47.97727411443536, 51.32957527854231, 143.63636710427022, 61.32957874644884], "fontSize": 10.00000346790653},
		{"text": "Figure 9:", "rect": [69.4772685657848, 529.20454268022, 103.64772449840197, 537.7045482288706], "fontSize": 8.50000554865062},
		{"text": "Contrast-enhanced photon-counting detector CT scans of the abdomen and pelvis in a 13-year-old male child with history of acute myeloid", "rect": [113.65909923206674, 529.3068216497247, 525.1022893732244, 537.3068140203302], "fontSize": 7.999992370605469},
		{"text": "leukemia. Images were obtained with fast-pitch, standard-resolution, multienergy scanning mode at 120 kV, pitch of 3.2, and reconstructed at 0.4 mm using", "rect": [69.4772685657848, 519.3636224920099, 525.0341033935547, 527.3636252663352], "fontSize": 8.000002774325367},
		{"text": "Bv44 kernel QIR3. Incidentally found mass in the right thigh was noted. The lesion is a biopsy-proven venous malformation. Retrospective spectral analysis with", "rect": [69.4772685657848, 509.35226856578475, 524.9545357444068, 517.35227134011], "fontSize": 8.000002774325196},
		{"text": "virtual noncontrast (VNC) and iodine map shows contrast enhancement of the mass. Additional optional reconstructions, including VNC, virtual noncalcium, and", "rect": [69.4772685657848, 499.32955377752126, 525.045464255593, 507.32955655184645], "fontSize": 8.000002774325196},
		{"text": "iodine maps can be generated as needed. QIR is quantum iterative reconstruction from Siemens Healthineers.", "rect": [69.4772685657848, 489.3863650235262, 386.76136363636357, 497.3863677978515], "fontSize": 8.00000277432531},
		{"text": "Figure 10:", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 121.01134976473722, 200.2499875155362, 129.51135531338784], "fontSize": 8.50000554865062},
		{"text": "Images demonstrate the effect of different automatic exposure control (AEC) image quality index (vendor term: CARE", "rect": [208.14772172407666, 121.11364954168147, 545.1136363636363, 129.11364191228697], "fontSize": 7.999992370605497},
		{"text": "keV IQ) levels on image quality and radiation dose. A 10-year-old patient with a history of double-outlet right ventricle, after the Rastelli", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 111.17042957652693, 545.0795121626419, 119.17043235085227], "fontSize": 8.000002774325338},
		{"text": "procedure, and right ventricular to pulmonary artery conduit stenosis, after recent conduit replacement, underwent photon-counting", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 101.15909645774147, 545.0795121626419, 109.15909923206681], "fontSize": 8.000002774325338},
		{"text": "detector CT (0.4-mm section thickness) of the chest with intravenous 1 mL/kg of contrast material (Isovue 300; Bracco Diagnostics) to", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 91.13636086203839, 545.0340687144886, 99.13636363636361], "fontSize": 8.000002774325225},
		{"text": "assess the postoperative conduit. Both examinations were performed with fast-pitch, standard-resolution, multienergy scanning mode", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 81.193192915483, 545.1249972256746, 89.19319568980822], "fontSize": 8.000002774325225},
		{"text": "at 120 kV, reconstructed with Br44 kernel and QIR3, and displayed at C:56 W:342. The images in", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 71.18185979669744, 446.62499167702407, 79.18186257102276], "fontSize": 8.000002774325324},
		{"text": "A", "rect": [448.3068154074928, 71.18185979669744, 453.64773143421513, 79.18186257102276], "fontSize": 8.000002774325324},
		{"text": "and", "rect": [455.4318237304687, 71.18185979669744, 467.0681970769708, 79.18186257102276], "fontSize": 8.000002774325324},
		{"text": "B", "rect": [468.5568237304687, 71.18185979669744, 473.89773975719095, 79.18186257102276], "fontSize": 8.000002774325324},
		{"text": "were obtained 2 months", "rect": [474.9659312855113, 71.18185979669744, 545.340926430442, 79.18186257102276], "fontSize": 8.000002774325324},
		{"text": "prior to images in", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 61.15908258611503, 211.37498682195485, 69.15908536044036], "fontSize": 8.000002774325331},
		{"text": "C", "rect": [212.954531582919, 61.15908258611503, 218.72726440429682, 69.15908536044036], "fontSize": 8.000002774325331},
		{"text": "and", "rect": [219.24998890269885, 61.15908258611503, 230.88635184548113, 69.15908536044036], "fontSize": 8.000002774325331},
		{"text": "D", "rect": [232.43181402033022, 61.15908258611503, 238.20454684170804, 69.15908536044036], "fontSize": 8.000002774325331},
		{"text": ", with different AEC image quality index levels (IQ80 to IQ40). Volume CT dose index was 2.48 mGy in", "rect": [237.95454545454544, 61.15908258611503, 537.909102006392, 69.15908536044036], "fontSize": 8.000002774325331},
		{"text": "A", "rect": [539.6931734952059, 61.15908258611503, 545.0340791182083, 69.15908536044036], "fontSize": 8.000002774325331},
		{"text": "and", "rect": [161.46589799360794, 51.13639900901098, 173.10226093639022, 59.136391379616484], "fontSize": 7.999992370605504},
		{"text": "B", "rect": [174.77271340110082, 51.13639900901098, 180.11362942782313, 59.136391379616484], "fontSize": 7.999992370605504},
		{"text": "and 1.23 mGy in", "rect": [181.4204406738281, 51.13639900901098, 232.2499882091175, 59.136391379616484], "fontSize": 7.999992370605504},
		{"text": "C", "rect": [233.97728659889913, 51.13639900901098, 239.75000901655713, 59.136391379616484], "fontSize": 7.999992370605504},
		{"text": "and", "rect": [240.38635253906247, 51.13639900901098, 252.02271548184478, 59.136391379616484], "fontSize": 7.999992370605504},
		{"text": "D", "rect": [253.75001387162638, 51.13639900901098, 259.5227362892844, 59.136391379616484], "fontSize": 7.999992370605504},
